config GOOGLE_TTF_TEST
	tristate "Google TTF test suite"
	depends on KUNIT
	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	help
	  Enables KUnit unit testing for the TTF module in GBMS.
	  TTF calculates remaining charging duration using adapter power limits, battery
	  health status, SOC thresholds, and CCCM temperature tables. The test suite
	  validates SOC time estimation, battery current reductions, adapter power constraints,
	  and invalid input error handling. Say Y or M to build the test suite as `google_ttf_test`.
